<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 74.9501 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 74.9501 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge fell to 74.9501 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Monday from 74.4000 on Sunday.</p>
<p>				    Jan 6		   Jan 5</p>
<p>    tenge per dollar	  74.9501		 74.4000</p>
<p>    volume ($ million)	 8.965		   4.190</p>
<p>				    Jan 6		   Dec 30</p>
<p>    tenge per mark	    47.7000		 47.7000</p>
<p>    volume (DM million)	0.090		   0.005</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
